kf6-kcodecs (6.30.0-0supralinux2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Remove the SupraLINUX REUSE lint gate from debian/rules: KDE 6.30 does
    not define full-tree REUSE compliance as a package-build requirement,
    and the gate aborted before the real upstream autotests could run.
  * Keep the KDE upstream test suite enabled through dh_auto_test.

